# Source Server Troubleshooting

The RiverMeadow migration appliance is an essential control plane component that is responsible for orchestrating the migration process. This guide covers details on troubleshooting the source server.


## Local Network Connectivity

This section of the guide details troubleshooting steps to verify that the migration appliance has local network connectivity.